----------------jQuery Fading method---------------

with jQuery you can fade an element in and out of visibility
jQuery has the following fade methods:
1. fadeIn()
2. fadeOut()
3. fadeToggle()
4. fadeTo()


1. fadeIn():- click karne pe content visible hoga

//fadeIn effect me pahle contentko display none karke rakhna padega

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>jQuery series</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h1 >Welcome to jQuery Series</h1>

    <div id="box" style="border:1px solid black;background-color: aqua;height:100px;width:100px;margin-bottom:20px;display:none">
        Div
    </div>

    <input type="button" value="Fade In" id="btn">



    <script src="https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jquery/3.7.1/jquery.min.js"></script>

    <script>
        $(document).ready(function(){
            $("#btn").click(function(){
                $("#box").fadeIn("slow");
            })
        })
    </script>
    
</body>
</html>

